    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Orientation for the MBBS Class of 2027 was held on January 23-25, 2023, in a virtual session. During the three-day Orientation, students were welcomed by the Office of Student Experience - Pakistan. Students were informed of University Policies and Guidelines as well as the Student Code of Conduct and Counselling Services, among others.",
